    p Regalia, B., Janowicz, K., and McKenzie, G. (2019): <a href="https://blake-regalia.net/resource/2019-TGIS_Topology.pdf" target="_blank">Computing and Querying Strict, Approximate, and Metrically-Refined Topological Relations in Linked Geographic Data.</a> Transactions in GIS.
